WEBVTT

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.660
Both today and tomorrow, I've got time to kick back.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.660
kyou mo ashita mo HIMAKKUSU

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
My family of four and I are going to stay the night.

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
gokazoku yonin de goippaku

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
Put on an Egyptian front and become a sphinx,

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
EGIPUTO kidori de SUFINKUSU

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
and for an American feeling, Texas!

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
AMERICA kibun de TEXAS

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
When you're sitting pretty, with enough and to spare,

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
yoyuu SHAKUSHAKUPPE itsumo

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
and yet you always shilly-shally,

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
funya funya de iruto

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:39.930
and your bitter face and bitter feelings both teeter-totter,

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:39.930
nigamushi hara no mushi nahe nahe to

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
it's time to get out of there!

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
tettai shichau yo

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.730
I am feeling Ultra Relax,

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.730
watashi ha URUTORA RIRAKKUSU

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.940
a wonderful, invincible Relax.

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.940
SUTEKI ni muteki na RIRAKKUSU

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.900
A one-step-above kind of Deluxe.

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.900
hito aji chigau ze DERAKKUSU

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:54.070
I may be a little jumbled,

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:54.070
toccharakatte mo

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:55.860
but when I'm called on, ba-ba-ba-ba-bang!

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:55.860
yobarerya PAPAPAPAAAN!

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:58.910
I always feel Relax,

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:58.910
watashi ha itsudemo RIRAKKUSU

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.870
a humble, simple, sort of Deluxe.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.870
WABISABI kikasete DERAKKUSU

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
Bright! Clear! Alert-headed, peep-peep!

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
BIKKARI! KIKKARI! saeteru ATAMA PII! PII!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.920
Keep your eyes on me, okay!?

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.920
watashi no KOTO dake mitete ne!

00:01:33.280 --> 00:01:36.780
My name is Kurata Sana, first year junior high school student.

00:01:36.780 --> 00:01:38.820
Amazing white bat Babbit.

00:01:38.820 --> 00:01:40.780
My butt's so itchy.

00:01:41.370 --> 00:01:42.790
If I don't think about it...

00:01:42.790 --> 00:01:44.790
...I won't regret it.

00:01:50.290 --> 00:01:51.790
If we don't see each other...

00:01:51.790 --> 00:01:53.800
...I can forget everything...

00:02:15.570 --> 00:02:16.780
Bye, bye...

00:02:18.570 --> 00:02:19.990
...Hayama.

00:02:22.870 --> 00:02:27.370
Run Away, Run Away,
Across the Ocean

00:02:28.290 --> 00:02:30.790
What's the matter, Sana-chan?

00:02:31.580 --> 00:02:33.590
Use the perfume on your face...

00:02:33.590 --> 00:02:37.380
...then you say, "I'm very excited about tomorrow's date".

00:02:38.590 --> 00:02:41.680
That's right... very excited...

00:02:41.680 --> 00:02:43.390
Producer, that's not right.

00:02:43.390 --> 00:02:46.060
It's "I can't wait for tomorrow's date".

00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:47.060
It doesn't matter.

00:02:47.060 --> 00:02:48.390
I won't work this way.

00:02:48.390 --> 00:02:49.480
This isn't good...

00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:51.770
...I really don't want to remember what happened...

00:02:51.770 --> 00:02:53.770
...but that's all I can think about.

00:02:54.360 --> 00:02:57.190
At a time like this, there's nothing you can do about it.

00:02:57.780 --> 00:02:59.570
But... if...

00:03:01.950 --> 00:03:03.160
...at that time...

00:03:05.450 --> 00:03:07.580
...I had noticed Hayama's true feelings...

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:11.670
Hey, do you want to do this shoot or not?

00:03:11.670 --> 00:03:13.580
I'm gonna have to switch you.

00:03:14.380 --> 00:03:15.960
This is no time to daydream, stupid.

00:03:15.960 --> 00:03:18.760
Don't treat me like a fool.

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:20.760
Sana-chan, wake up!
Are you all right?

00:03:20.760 --> 00:03:24.100
I'm trapped! This is a nightmare!

00:03:24.100 --> 00:03:26.470
This is what it means to be trapped.

00:03:26.680 --> 00:03:29.390
The movie you're starring in is finally going to be released this weekend, right?

00:03:29.390 --> 00:03:29.890
Sana-chan.

00:03:30.690 --> 00:03:32.480
About that...

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:36.360
...that, of course... I have to show up for the premiere even if the movie isn't using any ads.

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:37.860
Bang bang bang...

00:03:37.860 --> 00:03:38.860
What are you doing?!

00:03:38.860 --> 00:03:40.700
Sana-chan, there's one more thing...

00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:44.490
...I heard there's someone you like in school.

00:03:47.370 --> 00:03:48.580
It's here, it's here.

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:52.370
You look more feminine recently. Is it because of him?

00:03:52.370 --> 00:03:55.290
How does he look compared to Naozumi-kun?

00:03:55.880 --> 00:03:58.590
Um... isn't this an interview about "Mizu no Yakata" (Water Palace)?

00:03:58.590 --> 00:04:00.590
Who's he?! Is he in your class?!

00:04:00.590 --> 00:04:02.380
What does he look like? Is he cooler than Naozumi-kun?

00:04:02.380 --> 00:04:04.970
I want to know more...

00:04:04.970 --> 00:04:08.180
"Mizu no Yakata" is a very romantic movie.

00:04:08.180 --> 00:04:09.060
Please watch it.

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:10.890
The poster is upside-down.

00:04:12.770 --> 00:04:14.770
I can't take it anymore.
I'm in a lot of pain.

00:04:14.770 --> 00:04:18.480
I feel like I can't take this anymore.

00:04:18.480 --> 00:04:22.200
Even if I manage not to think about it, there's always someone bringing it up again.

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:25.070
Then I start thinking about it all over again.

00:04:31.160 --> 00:04:33.870
Let's summon up all the energy and keep working.

00:04:33.870 --> 00:04:35.460
Everything's done for today.

00:04:44.380 --> 00:04:47.180
I'm... in so much pain.

00:04:48.260 --> 00:04:49.600
It's no good...

00:04:50.770 --> 00:04:52.680
By focusing my energy on my job...

00:04:52.680 --> 00:04:56.060
...I thought I could forget everything if we don't see each other...

00:04:57.980 --> 00:04:59.940
I just can't do it...

00:05:01.690 --> 00:05:05.490
I just don't know what else to do anymore.

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:16.420
What are you doing?

00:05:16.420 --> 00:05:17.750
It squirted out.

00:05:19.380 --> 00:05:21.170
You're like a kid.

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:32.560
I'm sorry, I didn't do it on purpose.

00:05:32.890 --> 00:05:36.390
Hayama, let's go wash your face. Or it'll get sticky.

00:05:36.390 --> 00:05:39.690
Ok? Hurry! Ok? Hurry!

00:05:41.270 --> 00:05:42.860
Did you talk to her again?

00:05:42.860 --> 00:05:43.570
Huh?

00:05:43.860 --> 00:05:46.200
Did you talk to her again after what happened?

00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:47.570
Who?

00:05:47.570 --> 00:05:48.780
Sana.

00:05:56.290 --> 00:05:57.290
No.

00:05:59.460 --> 00:06:00.590
I see...

00:06:02.380 --> 00:06:03.960
Why did he turn away?

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:06.090
Why did he avoid the topic?

00:06:07.470 --> 00:06:09.390
He's still thinking about her...

00:06:16.480 --> 00:06:17.980
Akito-kun...

00:06:19.190 --> 00:06:20.190
Akito-kun...

00:06:20.560 --> 00:06:21.560
It's none of my business.

00:06:21.980 --> 00:06:23.570
What am I going to do about you?!

00:06:28.860 --> 00:06:32.160
None of my business.
This is none of my business.

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:33.370
Really!

00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:36.580
Sorry about that.

00:06:39.870 --> 00:06:41.080
Hayama!

00:06:41.170 --> 00:06:42.590
I'm leaving.

00:06:50.760 --> 00:06:51.680
Shake shake shake!

00:06:57.180 --> 00:06:59.480
Wonder what she's doing...

00:06:59.480 --> 00:07:01.230
What are you talking about?

00:07:01.270 --> 00:07:02.520
About Sana...

00:07:02.980 --> 00:07:05.190
Wonder what she's doing right now...

00:07:07.570 --> 00:07:08.860
Who knows?

00:07:18.290 --> 00:07:20.920
Wonder what she's been doing recently?

00:07:20.920 --> 00:07:22.790
I called her yesterday.

00:07:22.790 --> 00:07:26.880
But Shimura-san said "She comes home late every day because of work".

00:07:26.880 --> 00:07:28.760
Don't ask me if you already know it.

00:07:28.760 --> 00:07:31.760
Add tofu into curry. It tastes great.

00:07:32.390 --> 00:07:36.760
Sana-chan's movie "Mizu no Yakata" is premiering tomorrow.

00:07:36.760 --> 00:07:38.560
Aya-chan and I are going to see it.

00:07:38.560 --> 00:07:40.270
Akito-kun, do you want to go?

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:41.060
Not going.

00:07:41.390 --> 00:07:44.690
Sana-chan said on tv that she worked really hard on the movie.

00:07:44.690 --> 00:07:45.690
You're so annoying.

00:07:46.020 --> 00:07:49.690
Even though you already have a girlfriend, Akito-kun, you're still too cold.

00:07:49.690 --> 00:07:52.200
It's as if Sana-chan doesn't exist anymore.

00:07:52.280 --> 00:07:54.870
I told you not to mention her again.

00:07:54.990 --> 00:07:55.990
There's some curry there.

00:07:56.200 --> 00:07:58.410
Water
Palace

00:07:56.200 --> 00:07:58.410
Preview

00:07:58.870 --> 00:08:00.660
Ah... Sana-chan's movie.

00:08:01.370 --> 00:08:04.170
Because I love you...

00:08:04.170 --> 00:08:05.170
...I can't take you with me.

00:08:05.170 --> 00:08:06.880
Stay alive...

00:08:07.460 --> 00:08:09.300
You killed my brother!

00:08:10.170 --> 00:08:13.300
You're brothers...
Aren't you two here to kill me?

00:08:17.390 --> 00:08:20.470
From now on...

00:08:20.470 --> 00:08:22.980
From now on, I'll concentrate on my career.

00:08:26.480 --> 00:08:29.570
Really, you're in the past.

00:08:31.490 --> 00:08:34.280
Akito.

00:08:34.280 --> 00:08:36.660
Do you want to go watch Sana's movie tomorrow?

00:08:36.660 --> 00:08:40.290
I'm going with Tsuyoshi-kun tomorrow, want to go together?

00:08:40.580 --> 00:08:41.500
You're going...

00:08:43.330 --> 00:08:45.080
Tomorrow Premiere - Entire Country

00:08:45.460 --> 00:08:48.290
Tomorrow, I have karate.

00:08:48.290 --> 00:08:51.880
Akito-kun, we're still Sana-chan's friends.

00:08:52.470 --> 00:08:54.590
Aren't we still friends?

00:08:55.260 --> 00:08:57.970
Even though you already have a girlfriend...

00:08:58.260 --> 00:09:01.470
Even though you're going out with someone else.

00:09:01.470 --> 00:09:04.890
Aren't we still... friends?

00:09:12.280 --> 00:09:13.860
Good morning...

00:09:13.860 --> 00:09:19.490
The premiere of the movie "Mizu no Yakata" is going to take place in this theater.

00:09:19.490 --> 00:09:22.370
There's already a lot of people here waiting to get in.

00:09:22.370 --> 00:09:27.960
As Kurata Sana-chan and Kamura Naozumi-kun are
starring in this movie, it's sure to create lots of buzz.

00:09:27.960 --> 00:09:31.090
Great! Sana-chan's name came out before Naozumi-kun's.

00:09:31.090 --> 00:09:33.300
This is great...

00:09:33.300 --> 00:09:36.760
I told you, Naozumi, she won't lose to you in acting.

00:09:38.590 --> 00:09:39.970
Time's up.

00:09:39.970 --> 00:09:40.890
Rei-kun.

00:09:40.890 --> 00:09:42.390
Sana-chan, let's go.

00:09:43.890 --> 00:09:44.770
Pretty.

00:09:44.770 --> 00:09:46.690
You look different from before.

00:09:46.690 --> 00:09:47.690
Cute...

00:09:47.690 --> 00:09:51.690
Sana... today I'll be in the reserved seats.

00:09:53.190 --> 00:09:54.190
I'll go now.

00:09:55.860 --> 00:09:59.780
Kurata-san, there's a mail for you!
It's airmail!

00:09:59.780 --> 00:10:01.370
The mail box is here, here.

00:10:01.370 --> 00:10:03.290
Actually, that airmail letter...

00:10:04.370 --> 00:10:06.080
...is for Sana-chan...

00:10:07.290 --> 00:10:09.380
...and also Naozumi-kun...

00:10:10.290 --> 00:10:11.880
You're the only person who knows.

00:10:11.880 --> 00:10:13.380
Sorry to keep everyone waiting.

00:10:13.380 --> 00:10:15.170
The movie is going to start soon.

00:10:15.170 --> 00:10:18.260
The stars of the movie must greet the audience at the premiere.

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:20.390
Good morning!

00:10:20.390 --> 00:10:21.760
Good morning, Sana-chan.

00:10:21.760 --> 00:10:22.760
Yes.

00:10:22.760 --> 00:10:25.390
You look very charming today.

00:10:25.390 --> 00:10:27.270
Thank you, Naozumi-kun.

00:10:27.270 --> 00:10:29.270
Hey Maeda-san, what are you doing?

00:10:29.690 --> 00:10:30.900
Studying English?

00:10:30.900 --> 00:10:32.980
That's not it.

00:10:32.980 --> 00:10:35.360
It's airmail... from New York.

00:10:35.360 --> 00:10:39.280
What I get so far is that it's asking Naozumi to perform...

00:10:39.280 --> 00:10:41.160
Wow, Naozumi-kun, that's great!

00:10:41.160 --> 00:10:43.160
Sana-chan's name is on there too.

00:10:43.160 --> 00:10:44.790
No way! Where? Where?

00:10:44.790 --> 00:10:46.580
- See, right here...
- Really?

00:10:46.580 --> 00:10:48.910
What else does it say, Maeda-san?

00:10:48.910 --> 00:10:53.380
Sana Kurata-chan... I don't know.

00:10:53.380 --> 00:10:54.380
Why?

00:10:54.380 --> 00:10:57.380
Why? Because it's in English! English!

00:10:57.380 --> 00:11:01.260
My English sucks!
I don't understand it at all.

00:11:01.260 --> 00:11:04.140
Then just find someone who understands English.

00:11:04.140 --> 00:11:05.970
That's not that easy to find.

00:11:05.970 --> 00:11:07.770
Hi... Sana-chan... Naozumi-kun!

00:11:07.770 --> 00:11:10.480
I'm Talandalu. Long time no see!

00:11:10.480 --> 00:11:11.400
Really?

00:11:11.400 --> 00:11:12.900
Amazing.

00:11:13.690 --> 00:11:17.780
English letter? Leave everything to me. It's too easy.

00:11:17.780 --> 00:11:21.570
Talandalu is in Japan to shoot another commercial.

00:11:21.570 --> 00:11:24.160
When he heard Sana-chan's movie was premiering...

00:11:24.160 --> 00:11:25.580
...he came here as fast as he could.

00:11:26.490 --> 00:11:29.000
What's wrong, Mr. Talandalu?

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:31.870
Th... This is...

00:11:31.870 --> 00:11:35.090
This letter is from...

00:11:37.960 --> 00:11:40.880
What's "ecnetnes desrever gnitseretni"?

00:11:43.180 --> 00:11:45.890
It's actually "interesting reversed sentence".

00:11:47.100 --> 00:11:51.690
Mr. Gary Hamilton is the New York Broadway King!

00:11:51.690 --> 00:11:53.270
Number one producer!

00:11:53.270 --> 00:11:55.480
No one has ever seen him.

00:11:55.480 --> 00:11:58.280
This "H" is his symbol.

00:11:58.280 --> 00:12:03.360
He's inviting Naozumi-kun and Sana-chan to perform in a musical performance on stage.

00:12:03.360 --> 00:12:05.570
Wow! Congratulations!

00:12:05.570 --> 00:12:07.080
This is great news!

00:12:07.080 --> 00:12:12.160
I'm sorry... I ripped the letter,
I got too excited.

00:12:12.160 --> 00:12:16.380
Huh? Aren't you happy? Not happy?

00:12:16.380 --> 00:12:17.800
Must be candid camera.

00:12:17.800 --> 00:12:19.920
It's one of those shows where they trick you and film your reactions.

00:12:19.920 --> 00:12:20.880
Oh, No!

00:12:20.880 --> 00:12:23.090
This Talandalu must be a fake too.

00:12:24.590 --> 00:12:26.100
Talandalu is angry.

00:12:26.470 --> 00:12:29.390
Look into my eyes...
does it look like I'm lying?

00:12:29.390 --> 00:12:30.770
It looks like you are.

00:12:30.770 --> 00:12:32.770
This airmail is real.

00:12:32.770 --> 00:12:35.480
I'll reassure you with the serious Talandalu that you see before you.

00:12:35.480 --> 00:12:36.980
Shimura-san?

00:12:36.980 --> 00:12:38.570
Yes, airmail?

00:12:38.570 --> 00:12:40.570
Really? There's an "H" mark?

00:12:40.570 --> 00:12:44.780
Put it on the shrine! There's no shrine?

00:12:44.780 --> 00:12:46.570
One's also been sent home.

00:12:46.570 --> 00:12:49.870
The title of the musical is "Endless Summer"...

00:12:49.870 --> 00:12:52.870
The date of the first performance is already set...

00:12:52.870 --> 00:12:56.380
Hope you two can come to
New York as soon as possible...

00:12:56.380 --> 00:12:59.380
But Naozumi-kun and Sana-chan must come together...

00:12:59.380 --> 00:13:02.170
These are Mr. Hamilton's requirements.

00:13:02.170 --> 00:13:04.970
We believe you now, you don't have to put up that face anymore.

00:13:04.970 --> 00:13:06.970
Congratulations again!

00:13:06.970 --> 00:13:09.470
I knew that you'd have a great chance like this!

00:13:09.470 --> 00:13:13.270
I, Talandalu, will support you from the bottom of my heart!

00:13:13.270 --> 00:13:15.390
Maeda-san!
Sagami-san!

00:13:15.390 --> 00:13:17.060
This is great!

00:13:17.060 --> 00:13:20.070
Our hard work is finally paying off!

00:13:20.070 --> 00:13:23.690
But with Sana-chan, I'm a little worried.
But with Naozumi-kun, I'm a little worried.

00:13:23.690 --> 00:13:25.360
Sana-chan...

00:13:25.360 --> 00:13:28.070
This is very sudden...

00:13:28.070 --> 00:13:33.000
But a big Broadway producer like him wants to see us...

00:13:33.000 --> 00:13:35.000
This is a great honour.

00:13:36.170 --> 00:13:37.790
That's true... it's great news...

00:13:38.290 --> 00:13:41.300
New York is far away too...

00:13:41.300 --> 00:13:42.880
Sana-chan...

00:13:45.470 --> 00:13:48.260
I worked really hard on this project...

00:13:48.260 --> 00:13:52.100
With all of Kurata Sana-chan and Kamura Naozumi-kun's hard work...

00:13:52.100 --> 00:13:54.060
We had the best results possible...

00:13:54.060 --> 00:13:57.270
I believe everyone else will love it too.

00:13:58.190 --> 00:13:59.900
Water Palace

00:14:15.580 --> 00:14:17.000
Welcome...

00:14:17.580 --> 00:14:18.670
Guest...

00:14:22.090 --> 00:14:23.590
Because...

00:14:23.590 --> 00:14:25.090
...I love you...

00:14:25.090 --> 00:14:26.470
I can't take you with me.

00:14:29.590 --> 00:14:30.970
This is Shimura-san.

00:14:33.600 --> 00:14:35.560
Water Palace was great.

00:14:35.560 --> 00:14:37.560
Sana-chan, everyone's here...

00:14:37.560 --> 00:14:38.690
Everyone?

00:14:38.690 --> 00:14:41.270
Like Tsuyoshi-kun and Aya-chan.

00:14:41.270 --> 00:14:43.480
They haven't seen you in a long time so they want to see you.

00:14:43.480 --> 00:14:44.980
Who else is here?

00:14:44.980 --> 00:14:46.360
There's...

00:14:46.360 --> 00:14:51.160
There's Hisae-chan, and... everyone's here.

00:14:51.160 --> 00:14:52.780
Really?

00:14:52.780 --> 00:14:57.160
Sorry, please tell them I'll go back to school soon.

00:14:57.160 --> 00:14:58.290
You don't want to see them?

00:14:59.460 --> 00:15:00.580
It's like...

00:15:00.580 --> 00:15:02.290
It's like... ?

