Nao, let's go.

00:15:26.280 --> 00:15:28.070
Hey, hurry up.

00:15:31.570 --> 00:15:33.990
It was great.

00:15:34.580 --> 00:15:37.290
Water Palace was the greatest.

00:15:37.290 --> 00:15:38.540
Mama...

00:15:38.540 --> 00:15:44.750
The charms of this movie are almost all gathered around you and Kamura-kun.

00:15:45.420 --> 00:15:46.710
Really?

00:15:47.210 --> 00:15:48.380
Really.

00:15:48.880 --> 00:15:51.380
You did great.

00:15:52.680 --> 00:15:55.220
I'm now one of your biggest fans.

00:15:55.220 --> 00:15:56.470
Mama...

00:15:56.470 --> 00:15:58.720
- May I have your autograph?
- What?

00:15:58.720 --> 00:16:01.480
I got it! I got Sana-chan's autograph!

00:16:01.480 --> 00:16:02.690
Mother...

00:16:03.560 --> 00:16:05.980
About going to New York...
Is it a musical?

00:16:08.480 --> 00:16:12.700
I already checked... I called Mr. Hamilton's office in New York.

00:16:13.700 --> 00:16:15.530
It's the real thing.

00:16:15.990 --> 00:16:19.080
Maybe it's a good thing for you at this stage.

00:16:19.080 --> 00:16:20.870
Should I accept the offer?

00:16:20.870 --> 00:16:22.660
That's up to you.

00:16:23.080 --> 00:16:26.080
Even though it's going to be very challenging work...

00:16:27.380 --> 00:16:31.590
This is something an ordinary girl wouldn't be able to dream of...

00:16:32.170 --> 00:16:33.380
Dream?

00:16:35.590 --> 00:16:38.390
Hello? I'm Kurata Sana, 12 years old.

00:16:38.390 --> 00:16:40.560
Naozumi-kun? What is it?

00:16:40.560 --> 00:16:42.890
What? You're nearby?

00:16:43.270 --> 00:16:44.770
I'm in front of your house.

00:16:44.770 --> 00:16:46.980
I can see your mom slipping off the roof.

00:16:46.980 --> 00:16:48.570
Ah, the parachute opened.

00:16:48.570 --> 00:16:51.990
Ah, you're right, Naozumi-kun, why don't you come up here?!

00:16:51.990 --> 00:16:54.360
I can't, it's very late.

00:16:54.990 --> 00:16:56.240
Sana-chan...

00:16:57.660 --> 00:16:59.580
Let's go to New York.

00:17:00.990 --> 00:17:04.870
I was in New York last time for a commercial shoot.

00:17:04.870 --> 00:17:06.580
It's a great place.

00:17:06.580 --> 00:17:09.170
Everything is new and interesting...

00:17:09.170 --> 00:17:12.300
It's like I switched a new battery in my body...

00:17:12.800 --> 00:17:17.430
Together... we finished a difficult project like "Water Palace".

00:17:17.890 --> 00:17:21.270
I know we can do it... we can be better, Sana-chan.

00:17:21.270 --> 00:17:22.560
Let's do it!

00:17:23.980 --> 00:17:28.190
Naozumi-kun, you're amazing.
You know how to look forward.

00:17:28.190 --> 00:17:29.980
Sana-chan, it's because of you...

00:17:31.280 --> 00:17:34.280
You've influenced me
from the very beginning...

00:17:36.860 --> 00:17:41.290
That's why...
I don't want to see you depressed...

00:17:43.580 --> 00:17:45.160
Let's run away!

00:17:46.160 --> 00:17:48.790
Let's run away... together...

00:17:49.460 --> 00:17:50.840
Run away?

00:17:51.090 --> 00:17:54.130
Let's run away... together...

00:18:04.560 --> 00:18:06.180
Sana-chan...

00:18:06.180 --> 00:18:07.980
What's wrong, Zenjiro-sensei?

00:18:07.980 --> 00:18:12.190
This is unbelievable, I'm going to say goodbye to Sana-chan today!

00:18:12.190 --> 00:18:13.690
Why?

00:18:13.690 --> 00:18:16.700
Because there's been a change of plans, Kodocha is gonna be changed!

00:18:16.700 --> 00:18:18.200
This is so sudden...

00:18:18.780 --> 00:18:22.370
Starting next week, it'll change from
Child's Toy to Middle-aged women's Toy...

00:18:22.370 --> 00:18:23.290
What?

00:18:24.580 --> 00:18:27.870
There was a rumor that middle-aged women think of me like a toy...

00:18:27.870 --> 00:18:28.870
That's how this started...

00:18:29.580 --> 00:18:32.290
...loved by middle-aged women... maybe this is my luck.

00:18:32.290 --> 00:18:34.880
Kodocha...

00:18:35.880 --> 00:18:36.670
...is finished?

00:18:37.760 --> 00:18:40.390
Zenjiro-sensei, thank you for everything.

00:18:40.390 --> 00:18:42.600
Don't eat too much...

00:18:43.100 --> 00:18:45.060
Sensei, you too... even though you keep being dumped by women...

00:18:45.060 --> 00:18:48.060
- Kodocha... is finished?
- You must stay strong and move on.

00:18:49.190 --> 00:18:51.400
This was my first job...

00:19:00.570 --> 00:19:04.080
My surroundings are changing quickly...

00:19:04.080 --> 00:19:08.290
Things that are important to me are disappearing slowly.

00:19:11.960 --> 00:19:13.460
Let's run away, Sana-chan.

00:19:14.090 --> 00:19:15.380
Let's run away.

